{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56534","headline":"还丹歌 三 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长生药，不死丹，世人欲作寻复难。\n心犹豫，意迟疑，八丹方法由来有，如何不取一门知。\n二人语，共商量，日夜寻思不死方。\n若取黑铅幷姹女，腾身天上自翱翔。\n一爲左，一爲右，阴阳具足还丹就。\n真须链，必长生，逍遥自在紫云庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}